etric stat cards (with deltas), an overall progress bar, and a list of today’s 3 todos. Title it “Project dashboard”.`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.title":`Project dashboard (example)`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.metrics":`This week’s key metrics`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.done":`Completed`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.blocked":`Blocked`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.duration":`Avg. cycle time`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.coverage":`Coverage`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.progress":`Overall progress`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.milestone":`v1.0 milestone`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.todo":`Today’s todos`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.todo1":`Review the M1 template-center PR`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.todo2":`Sync vendor to SSiD`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.todo3":`Wednesday standup deck`,"tpl.compare.name":`Option comparison`,"tpl.compare.desc":`Options scored dimension by dimension — the contested cells jump out.`,"tpl.compare.instruction":`Use dsh-ui to turn these options into a comparison table: options A/B/C × dimensions (cost / complexity / risk / payoff), marking the recommended column; add a callout at the top stating the conclusion.`,"tpl.compare.demo.title":`Option comparison (example)`,"tpl.compare.demo.conclusion":`Conclusion`,"tpl.compare.demo.body":`Option B wins overall: medium cost, low complexity, low risk.`,"tpl.compare.demo.dimension":`Dimension`,"tpl.compare.demo.optionA":`Option A`,"tpl.compare.demo.optionB":`Option B ★`,"tpl.compare.demo.optionC":`Option C`,"tpl.compare.demo.cost":`Cost`,"tpl.compare.demo.complexity":`Complexity`,"tpl.compare.demo.risk":`Risk`,"tpl.compare.demo.payoff":`Payoff`,"tpl.compare.demo.high":`High`,"tpl.compare.demo.medium":`Medium`,"tpl.compare.demo.low":`Low`,"tpl.compare.demo.large":`Large`,"tpl.compare.demo.small":`Small`,"tpl.steps.name":`Five-step walkthrough`,"tpl.steps.desc":`Key steps on a timeline, one line each — for tutorials, handovers and release runbooks.`,"tpl.steps.instruction":`Use dsh-ui to turn the procedure into a steps walkthrough: 5 steps following the real flow, each with a title and a line or