 does a panel:true fence render?`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q3a":`The message flow`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q3b":`The session panel dock`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q3bfx":`✓ Panel updates never spam the transcript.`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q3c":`The settings page`,"tpl.stats.name":`Key figures + progress`,"tpl.stats.desc":`Numbers, progress and milestones in one delivery — the standard weekly report.`,"tpl.stats.instruction":`Use dsh-ui to summarize this week: a keyvalue block with 3 key figures, two progress bars (planned vs actual), and a timeline with 3 milestones. Title it “Weekly snapshot”.`,"tpl.stats.demo.title":`Weekly snapshot (example)`,"tpl.stats.demo.done":`Completed`,"tpl.stats.demo.late":`Late`,"tpl.stats.demo.risk":`Risks`,"tpl.stats.demo.riskValue":`2 (both mitigated)`,"tpl.stats.demo.planned":`Planned progress`,"tpl.stats.demo.actual":`Actual progress`,"tpl.stats.demo.mon":`Monday`,"tpl.stats.demo.monDesc":`M1 development complete`,"tpl.stats.demo.wed":`Wednesday`,"tpl.stats.demo.wedDesc":`End-to-end verification passed`,"tpl.stats.demo.fri":`Friday`,"tpl.stats.demo.friDesc":`Shipped 0.9.4`,"tpl.chart.name":`Trend chart`,"tpl.chart.desc":`Data drawn straight into a chart — multiple series, trend visible at a glance.`,"tpl.chart.instruction":`Use dsh-ui to plot this data as a chart (bars, multi-series): completed vs planned over the last 6 weeks, with a one-line trend conclusion above the chart.`,"tpl.chart.demo.title":`Trend comparison (example)`,"tpl.chart.demo.conclusion":`Conclusion: completions rose 3 weeks running and overtook plan for the first time this week.`,"tpl.tabs.name":`Tabbed sections`,"tpl.tabs.desc":`A big block split into tabs: clear anchors, an uncluttered panel, no transcript spam.`,"tpl.tabs.instruction":`Use dsh-ui to split the content into three tabs: Overview / Details / FAQ, at most 3 points per tab. Title it “Feature tour”.`,"tpl.tabs.demo.title":`Feature tour (example)`,"tpl.tabs.demo.overview":`Overview`,"tpl.tabs.demo.overviewBody":`Three capabilities: live re