 service`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q1b":`A plugin (a cordis plugin)`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q1bfx":`✓ Everything is a plugin: services, tools and UI all register through one.`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q1c":`A tool`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q1exp":`DSH is built on cordis: every capability, services and tools included, registers as a plugin.`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q2":`Who emits a dsh-ui fence?`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q2a":`The user`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q2b":`The model`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q2bfx":`✓ The model writes the dsh-ui fence into its reply.`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q2c":`The host`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q2exp":`The model emits the fence; the renderer paints it into real components.`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q3":`Where does a panel:true fence render?`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q3a":`The message flow`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q3b":`The session panel dock`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q3bfx":`✓ Panel updates never spam the transcript.`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q3c":`The settings page`,"tpl.stats.name":`Key figures + progress`,"tpl.stats.desc":`Numbers, progress and milestones in one delivery — the standard weekly report.`,"tpl.stats.instruction":`Use dsh-ui to summarize this week: a keyvalue block with 3 key figures, two progress bars (planned vs actual), and a timeline with 3 milestones. Title it “Weekly snapshot”.`,"tpl.stats.demo.title":`Weekly snapshot (example)`,"tpl.stats.demo.done":`Completed`,"tpl.stats.demo.late":`Late`,"tpl.stats.demo.risk":`Risks`,"tpl.stats.demo.riskValue":`2 (both mitigated)`,"tpl.stats.demo.planned":`Planned progress`,"tpl.stats.demo.actual":`Actual progress`,"tpl.stats.demo.mon":`Monday`,"tpl.stats.demo.monDesc":`M1 development complete`,"tpl.stats.demo.wed":`Wednesday`,"tpl.stats.demo.wedDesc":`End-to-end verification passed`,"tpl.stats.demo.fri":`Friday`,"tpl.stats.demo.friDesc":`Shipped 0.9.4`,"tpl.chart.name":`Trend chart`,"tpl.chart.desc":`Data drawn straight into a chart — multiple series, trend visible at a glance.`,"tpl.chart.instruction":`Use dsh-ui to plot this data as a chart (bars, multi-series): completed vs planned over the last 6 weeks, with a one-l