ategory.data":`Data`,"tpl.category.flow":`Flow`,"tpl.category.chart":`Charts`,"tpl.category.interactive":`Interactive`,"tpl.category.quiz":`Quiz`,"tpl.category.advanced":`Advanced`,"tpl.categories.aria":`Template categories`,"tpl.try":`Try it: insert into composer`,"tpl.copy":`Copy instruction`,"tpl.copied":`✓ Copied`,"tpl.boundary.preview":`template preview`,"tpl.boundary.achievements":`trophy page`,"tpl.dashboard.name":`Project dashboard`,"tpl.dashboard.desc":`Core metrics on one card: numbers, deltas and a progress bar — the decision at a glance.`,"tpl.dashboard.instruction":`Use dsh-ui to build a dashboard for this project: 4 key-metric stat cards (with deltas), an overall progress bar, and a list of today’s 3 todos. Title it “Project dashboard”.`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.title":`Project dashboard (example)`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.metrics":`This week’s key metrics`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.done":`Completed`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.blocked":`Blocked`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.duration":`Avg. cycle time`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.coverage":`Coverage`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.progress":`Overall progress`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.milestone":`v1.0 milestone`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.todo":`Today’s todos`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.todo1":`Review the M1 template-center PR`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.todo2":`Sync vendor to SSiD`,"tpl.dashboard.demo.todo3":`Wednesday standup deck`,"tpl.compare.name":`Option comparison`,"tpl.compare.desc":`Options scored dimension by dimension — the contested cells jump out.`,"tpl.compare.instruction":`Use dsh-ui to turn these options into a comparison table: options A/B/C × dimensions (cost / complexity / risk / payoff), marking the recommended column; add a callout at the top stating the conclusion.`,"tpl.compare.demo.title":`Option comparison (example)`,"tpl.compare.demo.conclusion":`Conclusion`,"tpl.compare.demo.body":`Option B wins overall: medium cost, low complexity, low risk.`,"tpl.compare.demo.dimension":`Dimension`,"tpl.compare.demo.optionA":`Option A`,"tpl.compare.demo.optionB":`Option B ★`,"tpl.compare.demo.optionC":`Option C`,"tpl.compare.demo.cost":`Cost`,"tpl.compare.demo.complexity":`Complexity`,"tpl.compare.demo.risk":`Risk`,"tpl.compare.demo.payoff":`Payoff`,"tpl.compare.demo.high":`High`,"tpl.compare.demo.medium":`Medium`,"tpl.compare.demo.low":`Low`,"tpl.compare.demo.large":`Large`,"tpl.compare.demo.small":`Small`,"tpl.steps.name":`Five-step walkthrough`,"tpl.steps.desc":`Key steps on a timeline, one line each — for tutorials, handovers and release runbooks.`,"tpl.steps.instruction":`Use dsh-ui to turn the procedure into a steps walkthrough: 5 steps following the real flow, each with a title and a line or two of detail, with a badge at the top showing the expected duration.`,"tpl.steps.demo.title":`Getting started (example)`,"tpl.steps.demo.badge":`About 5 minutes`,"tpl.steps.demo.s1":`Install the plugin`,"tpl.steps.demo.s1desc":`From the plugin center, or npm-install it into your profile`,"tpl.steps.demo.s2":`Send your first instruction`,"tpl.steps.demo.s2desc":`Ask the model to answer with a dsh-ui interface`,"tpl.steps.demo.s3":`Try the interaction`,"tpl.steps.demo.s3desc":`Click a button, grade a quiz, switch a tab — actions travel back to the model`,"tpl.steps.demo.s4":`Pin a panel`,"tpl.steps.demo.s4desc":`The model uses panel:true to pin results to the session panel`,"tpl.steps.demo.s5":`Advanced components`,"tpl.steps.demo.s5desc":`Charts, diagrams and 3D load lazily, on demand`,"tpl.quiz.name":`Pop quiz`,"tpl.quiz.desc":`Graded the moment you answer: right or wrong plus an explanation — good for training.`,"tpl.quiz.instruction":`Use dsh-ui to write 3 pop-quiz questions (quiz component: question + options, exactly one correct, each with an explanation), titled “Pop quiz”, graded as soon as an option is picked.`,"tpl.quiz.demo.title":`Pop quiz (example)`,"tpl.quiz.demo.hint":`Picking an option grades it instantly and reveals the explanation.`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q1":`What is the smallest unit of a DSH plugin?`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q1a":`A service`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q1b":`A plugin (a cordis plugin)`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q1bfx":`✓ Everything is a plugin: services, tools and UI all register through one.`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q1c":`A tool`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q1exp":`DSH is built on cordis: every capability, services and tools included, registers as a plugin.`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q2":`Who emits a dsh-ui fence?`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q2a":`The user`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q2b":`The model`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q2bfx":`✓ The model writes the dsh-ui fence into its reply.`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q2c":`The host`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q2exp":`The model emits the fence; the renderer paints it into real components.`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q3":`Where does a panel:true fence render?`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q3a":`The message flow`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q3b":`The session panel dock`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q3bfx":`✓ Panel updates never spam the transcript.`,"tpl.quiz.demo.q3c":`The settings page`,"tpl.stats.name":`Key figures + progress`,"tpl.stats.desc":`Numbers, progress and milestones in one delivery — the standard weekly report.`,"tpl.stats.instruction":`Use dsh-ui to summarize this week: a keyvalue block with 3 key figures, two progress bars (planned vs actual), and a timeline with 3 milestones. Title it “Weekly snapshot”.`,"tpl.stats.demo.title":`Weekly snapshot (example)`,"tpl.stats.demo.done":`Completed`,"tpl.stats.demo.late":`Late`,"tpl.stats.demo.risk":`Risks`,"tpl.stats.demo.riskValue":`2 (both mitigated)`,"tpl.stats.demo.planned":`Planned progress`,"tpl.stats.demo.actual":`Actual progress`,"tpl.stats.demo.mon":`Monday`,"tpl.stats.demo.monDesc":`M1 development complete`,"tpl.stats.demo.wed":`Wednesday`,"tpl.stats.demo.wedDesc":`End-to-end verification passed`,"tpl.stats.demo.fri":`Friday`,"tpl.stats.demo.friDesc":`Shipped 0.9.4`,"tpl.chart.name":`Trend chart`,"tpl.chart.desc":`Data drawn straight into a chart — multiple series, trend visible at a glance.`,"tpl.chart.instruction":`Use dsh-ui to plot this data as a chart (bars, multi-series): completed vs planned over the last 6 weeks, with a one-line trend conclusion above the chart.`,"tpl.chart.demo.title":`Trend comparison (example)`,"tpl.chart.demo.conclusion":`Conclusion: completions rose 3 weeks running and overtook plan for the first time this week.`,"tpl.tabs.name":`Tabbed sections`,"tpl.tabs.desc":`A big block split into tabs: clear anchors, an uncluttered panel, no transcript spam.`,"tpl.tabs.instruction":`Use dsh-ui to split the content into three tabs: Overview / Details / FAQ, at most 3 points per tab. Title it “Feature tour”.`,"tpl.tabs.demo.title":`Feature tour (example)`,"tpl.tabs.demo.overview":`Overview`,"tpl.tabs.demo.overviewBody":`Three capabilities: live rendering, action round-trips, and a persistent panel.`,"tpl.tabs.demo.details":`Details`,"tpl.tabs.demo.d1":`Rendering: incremental fence parsing, painted as it streams`,"tpl.tabs.demo.d2":`Interaction: actions travel back and the model updates in place`,"tpl.tabs.demo.d3":`Panel: a session-level dock you can collapse and resize`,"tpl.tabs.demo.faqBody":`Q: What if the model never replies? A: Components still grade and expand locally.`,"tpl.checklist.name":`Release checklist`,"tpl.checklist.desc":`Tick every box before you ship: the list is the process, and gaps are visible.`,"tpl.checklist.instruction":`Use dsh-ui to build a release checklist: 6 tickable checkbox items (tests / docs / release / rollback / monitoring / announcement), with a badge at the top reading “Tick everything before merging”.`,"tpl.checklist.demo.title":`Release checklist (example)`,"tpl.checklist.demo.badge":`Tick everything before merging`,"tpl.checklist.demo.c1":`Unit tests pass`,"tpl.checklist.demo.c2":`Docs updated`,"tpl.checklist.demo.c3":`Release bundle ready`,"tpl.checklist.demo.c4":`Rollback plan`,"tpl.accordion.name":`FAQ accordion`,"tpl.accordion.desc":`Questions and answers folded away: long documents get short and answers stop intimidating.`,"tpl.accordion.instruction":`Use dsh-ui to build an FAQ accordion: 5 common questions, the question as the header and the answer inside, with the first one expanded by default.`,"tpl.accordion.demo.title":`FAQ (example)`,"tpl.accordion.demo.q1":`Which chart types are supported?`,"tpl.accordion.demo.a1":`chart (bars/line/donut), plot for function graphs, and echart for the full chart library.`,"tpl.accordion.demo.q2":`Does the panel persist?`,"tpl.accordion.demo.a2":`The same content fingerprint restores its state across refresh and replay; new content resets.`,"tpl.accordion.demo.q3":`Do interactions disturb the model?`,"tpl.accordion.demo.a3":`Only components carrying an action send anything; pure display costs zero round-trips.`,"tpl.diagram.name":`System architecture`,"tpl.diagram.desc":`Select diagram nodes to read details and update connected components.`,"tpl.diagram.instruction":`Use dsh-ui to draw an interactive architecture diagram with five connected nodes (kind: architecture or flowchart). Add a description to each node. Selecting a node must show its explanation and update the diagram shared field for sibling components.`,"tpl.diagram.demo.title":`Architecture (example)`,"tpl.diagram.demo.caption":`DSH plugin path`,"tpl.diagram.demo.model":`Model`,"tpl.diagram.demo.plugin":`Plugin`,"tpl.diagram.demo.host":`Host`,"tpl.diagram.demo.modelDetail":`Generates the response and the interactive interface.`,"tpl.diagram.demo.pluginDetail":`Validates the dsh-ui data and renders its components.`,"tpl.diagram.demo.hostDetail":`Connects local selections to the surrounding interface.`,"tpl.diagram.demo.linked":`The selected plugin node updated this explanation through the shared field.`,"tpl.3d.name":`3D scene`,"tpl.3d.desc":`A rotatable 3D scene — for product demos and spatial explanations.`,"tpl.3d.instruction":`Use dsh-ui to render a 3D scene (scene3d): a cube and a sphere, titled “Example scene”, with a sentence on when to use it.`,"tpl.3d.demo.title":`3D scene (example)`,"tpl.3d.demo.note":`The first load downloads three.js (~700KB, lazily); afterwards it comes from cache.